  "source": "uml ropUmlStructure \"РОП — компоненты, деятельность и развёртывание\"\ndiagram D02_component \"Диаграмма компонентов\" type=component\ncomponent D02_component.ui Веб-интерфейс\nview D02_component.uiView \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.ui\ncomponent D02_component.auth \"Проверка прав и аудит\"\nview D02_component.authView \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.auth\ncomponent D02_component.bom \"BOM и правила\"\nview D02_component.bomView \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.bom\ncomponent D02_component.content \"Расчёты и контент\"\nview D02_component.contentView \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.content\ncomponent D02_component.pub \"Публикации и очередь\"\nview D02_component.pubView \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.pub\ncomponent D02_component.sup \"Адаптеры поставщиков\"\nview D02_component.supView \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.sup\ncomponent D02_component.db \"Репозитории PostgreSQL\"\nview D02_component.dbView \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.db\ncomponent D02_component.ext \"PC4Games и ITPartner\"\nview D02_component.extView \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.ext\ncomponent D02_component.oz \"Ozon Seller\"\nview D02_component.ozView \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.oz\ncomponent D02_component.media \"Хранилище изображений\"\nview D02_component.mediaView \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.media\ndependency D02_component.edge1 \"HTTPS / JSON\" from=D02_component.ui to=D02_component.bom\nview view_f2eee51100bb \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.edge1 from=D02_component.uiView to=D02_component.bomView\ndependency D02_component.edge2 \"проверка роли\" from=D02_component.bom to=D02_component.auth\nview view_94e60b1030a3 \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.edge2 from=D02_component.bomView to=D02_component.authView\ndependency D02_component.edge3 репозитории from=D02_component.bom to=D02_component.db\nview view_833952246188 \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.edge3 from=D02_component.bomView to=D02_component.dbView\ndependency D02_component.edge4 предложения from=D02_component.bom to=D02_component.sup\nview view_e6b14c0f8a9e \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.edge4 from=D02_component.bomView to=D02_component.supView\ndependency D02_component.edge5 адаптер from=D02_component.sup to=D02_component.ext\nview view_dfc9ef526c60 \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.edge5 from=D02_component.supView to=D02_component.extView\ndependency D02_component.edge6 \"версия BOM\" from=D02_component.bom to=D02_component.content\nview view_c247b7d2793a \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.edge6 from=D02_component.bomView to=D02_component.contentView\ndependency D02_component.edge7 \"версия карточки\" from=D02_component.content to=D02_component.pub\nview view_d032c2569ede \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.edge7 from=D02_component.contentView to=D02_component.pubView\ndependency D02_component.edge8 \"HTTPS / JSON\" from=D02_component.pub to=D02_component.oz\nview view_0a7d163ac1c8 \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.edge8 from=D02_component.pubView to=D02_component.ozView\ndependency D02_component.edge9 файлы from=D02_component.content to=D02_component.media\nview view_d34f5948fcae \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.edge9 from=D02_component.contentView to=D02_component.mediaView\nannotation annotation_24d313a94de0 \"Модульный монолит. Репозитории и аудит используются всеми бизнес-модулями; повторяющиеся зависимости опущены для читаемости.\"\nview annotation_24d313a94de0View \"\" diagram=D02_component element=annotation_24d313a94de0\ndiagram D06_activity \"Деятельность по подготовке и публикации карточки\" activity=prepareCard type=activity\nactivity prepareCard \"Деятельность по подготовке и публикации карточки\"\ninitial D06_activity.a \"\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.aView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.a\naction D06_activity.b \"Выбрать BOM\\nсоздать новую версию\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.bView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.b\naction D06_activity.c \"Изменить состав\\nи разрешить группы\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.cView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.c\ndecision D06_activity.d \"Совместимо и\\nданные актуальны?\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.dView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.d\naction D06_activity.e \"Рассчитать показатели\\nподготовить контент\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.eView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.e\naction D06_activity.f \"Утвердить\\nи запустить публикацию\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.fView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.f\naction D06_activity.g \"Зафиксировать успех\\nили ошибку и уведомить\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.gView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.g\nactivityFinal D06_activity.z \"\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.zView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.z\naction D06_activity.fix \"Показать конфликт\\nисправить данные\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.fixView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.fix\nmerge D06_activity.mergeCorrections \"\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.mergeCorrectionsView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.mergeCorrections\ncontrolFlow D06_activity.continueEditing \"\" from=D06_activity.mergeCorrections owner=prepareCard to=D06_activity.c\nview view_9f065ac32eb7 \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.continueEditing from=D06_activity.mergeCorrectionsView to=D06_activity.cView\ncontrolFlow D06_activity.edge1 \"\" from=D06_activity.a owner=prepareCard to=D06_activity.b\nview view_a2f1a9fbb4bc \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.edge1 from=D06_activity.aView to=D06_activity.bView\ncontrolFlow D06_activity.edge2 \"\" from=D06_activity.b owner=prepareCard to=D06_activity.mergeCorrections\nview view_5590e6de15c1 \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.edge2 from=D06_activity.bView to=D06_activity.mergeCorrectionsView\ncontrolFlow D06_activity.edge3 \"\" from=D06_activity.c owner=prepareCard to=D06_activity.d\nview view_dcb5933591dd \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.edge3 from=D06_activity.cView to=D06_activity.dView\ncontrolFlow D06_activity.edge4 \"\" from=D06_activity.d guard=else owner=prepareCard to=D06_activity.fix\nview view_f36328fe2d5e \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.edge4 from=D06_activity.dView to=D06_activity.fixView\ncontrolFlow D06_activity.edge5 \"\" from=D06_activity.fix owner=prepareCard to=D06_activity.mergeCorrections\nview view_57dbd81a1289 \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.edge5 from=D06_activity.fixView to=D06_activity.mergeCorrectionsView\ncontrolFlow D06_activity.edge6 \"\" from=D06_activity.d guard=\"Совместимо и данные актуальны\" owner=prepareCard to=D06_activity.e\nview view_8a557d815885 \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.edge6 from=D06_activity.dView to=D06_activity.eView\ncontrolFlow D06_activity.edge7 \"\" from=D06_activity.e owner=prepareCard to=D06_activity.f\nview view_f7c1fe2d9113 \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.edge7 from=D06_activity.eView to=D06_activity.fView\ncontrolFlow D06_activity.edge8 \"\" from=D06_activity.f owner=prepareCard to=D06_activity.g\nview view_d912a5b4aa24 \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.edge8 from=D06_activity.fView to=D06_activity.gView\ncontrolFlow D06_activity.edge9 \"\" from=D06_activity.g owner=prepareCard to=D06_activity.z\nview view_00fdcb3fbcdf \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.edge9 from=D06_activity.gView to=D06_activity.zView\ndiagram D21_deployment \"Диаграмма развёртывания\" type=deployment\ndevice D21_deployment.client \"Рабочие станции\\nБраузеры сотрудников\"\nview D21_deployment.clientView \"\" diagram=D21_deployment element=D21_deployment.client\nnode D21_deployment.edge \"Шлюз / DMZ\\nNginx: HTTPS 443\\nTLS и маршрутизация\"\nview D21_deployment.edgeView \"\" diagram=D21_deployment element=D21_deployment.edge\nnode D21_deployment.app \"Прикладной сервер\\nJRE 21: Spring Boot\\nAPI и worker публикаций\"\nview D21_deployment.appView \"\" diagram=D21_deployment element=D21_deployment.app\nnode D21_deployment.db \"Сервер БД\\nPostgreSQL 18\\nДанные и очередь\"\nview D21_deployment.dbView \"\" diagram=D21_deployment element=D21_deployment.db\nnode D21_deployment.media \"Файловое хранилище\\nИзображения по storage_key\"\nview D21_deployment.mediaView \"\" diagram=D21_deployment element=D21_deployment.media\nnode D21_deployment.ext \"Ozon и поставщики\\nИнтернет\"\nview D21_deployment.extView \"\" diagram=D21_deployment element=D21_deployment.ext\nnode D21_deployment.backup \"Резервное хранилище\\nБД и изображения\\nОтдельные учётные данные\"\nview D21_deployment.backupView \"\" diagram=D21_deployment element=D21_deployment.backup\ncommunicationPath D21_deployment.edge1 \"\" from=D21_deployment.client port=443 protocol=HTTPS to=D21_deployment.edge\nview view_f96bde997d4f \"\" diagram=D21_deployment element=D21_deployment.edge1 from=D21_deployment.clientView to=D21_deployment.edgeView\ncommunicationPath D21_deployment.edge2 \"\" from=D21_deployment.edge port=8443 protocol=HTTPS to=D21_deployment.app\nview view_5345000098e1 \"\" diagram=D21_deployment element=D21_deployment.edge2 from=D21_deployment.edgeView to=D21_deployment.appView\ncommunicationPath D21_deployment.edge3 \"\" from=D21_deployment.app port=5432 protocol=TLS to=D21_deployment.db\nview view_3658198868ab \"\" diagram=D21_deployment element=D21_deployment.edge3 from=D21_deployment.appView to=D21_deployment.dbView\ncommunicationPath D21_deployment.edge4 \"\" from=D21_deployment.app port=443 protocol=HTTPS to=D21_deployment.ext\nview view_c3bb90a8d86c \"\" diagram=D21_deployment element=D21_deployment.edge4 from=D21_deployment.appView t