ity.aView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.a\naction D06_activity.b \"Выбрать BOM\\nсоздать новую версию\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.bView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.b\naction D06_activity.c \"Изменить состав\\nи разрешить группы\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.cView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.c\ndecision D06_activity.d \"Совместимо и\\nданные актуальны?\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.dView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.d\naction D06_activity.e \"Рассчитать показатели\\nподготовить контент\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.eView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.e\naction D06_activity.f \"Утвердить\\nи запустить публикацию\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.fView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.f\naction D06_activity.g \"Зафиксировать успех\\nили ошибку и уведомить\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.gView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.g\nactivityFinal D06_activity.z \"\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.zView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.z\naction D06_activity.fix \"Показать конфликт\\nисправить данные\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.fixView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.fix\nmerge D06_activity.mergeCorrections \"\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.mergeCorrectionsView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.mergeCorrections\ncontrolFlow D06_activity.continueEditing \"\" from=D06_activity.mergeCorrections owner=prepareCard to=D06_activity.c\nview view_9f065ac32eb7 \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.continueEditing from=D06_activity.mergeCorrectionsView to=D06_activity.cView\ncontrolFlow D06_activity.edge1 \"\" from=D06_activity.a owner=prepareCard to=D06_activity.b\nview view_a2f1a9fbb4bc \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.edge1 from=D06_activity.aView to=D06_activity.bView\ncontrolFlow D06_activity.edge2 \"\" from=D06_activity.b owne